Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my struggles\Nshoot me through the sky It'd be a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,if we lingered here And let our pretty\Nsparks of life dwindle out and disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even you can't\Nnavigate If someone strong like you is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then who will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause when the waves cast my heart\Nadrift, it's been your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and your strength That would free\Nme from the mist And just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn Weigh anchor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,ride as high as you can I assure I\Ndon't need anger I go fast as I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I hear you laughing like you're numb\Nto it all But we're dashing together No,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we're never gonna fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the whole world may\Nnow be my enemy. Water's slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ain't backing down\Nso long as I'm free,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah Thought I'd give it, come\Nride the current with me All in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,wake up bright and early,\Nmaking for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You may look different, but you're\Nas impudent as ever. Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind and body have caught\Nup to your Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to reach awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What a ridiculous transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've worked so hard to build this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you've taken so\Nmuch of it away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My crew and my castle are in ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And what have you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost some, but we'll take\Nway more back when I'm through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Candle Dragon Swarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're having a ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Every floor of the castle is on fire,\Nand it seems to be spreading fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your crew and thousands\Nof soldiers are suffering inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon there'll be nothing but ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried at all. They're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I left that job to them, and\NI know my friends can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need to focus on is\Nkicking your scaly ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stupid laugh is pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Demolition God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the towers are burning too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:04:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are we supposed to run now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did everybody go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too much fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Zoro, and Sanji, and Franky,\NBrook, Usa, Robin, and Jinbe too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be in the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we put it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we find the rest of the crew,\Nthe entire island is one big inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where would we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless Onigashima lands,\Nwe're not safe anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zeus, can't you use your\Nrain to help put out the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I get burned?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We all worked really hard to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't end like this when we're\Nso close to winning. We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Luffy's gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm cooking over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm slowly dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.66,0:05:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not hauling your corpse! Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.26,0:05:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's a way out, I don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this might be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, come save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, my precious afro is\Ngetting even frizzier. This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll end\Nup looking like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What skeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,May your poor, tortured\Nsoul rest at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It breaks my heart just looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No one deserves to be such a cruel end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn to the bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This terrible fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear it'll take us all! Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a burnt corpse. I am dead, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is becoming a bit\Noppressive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear there may be no way out for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, we can't get outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole yard is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,An endless abyss in front\Nand a hellish fire behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.76,0:07:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck and couldn't\Nturn back if we wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we're stuck in the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,surrounded by fire with\Nthe island collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll come up with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We all know it's hot, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Break the damn wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stay in this spot\Nlong, we're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to lose an arm than lose your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of those giant\Nmuscles if you're not gonna use them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.34,0:07:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running, but frankly,\NI don't know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A suggestion would be welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had any ideas, I'd tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll all suffocate to death at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.28,0:08:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no more I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.44,0:08:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Star Sprinkler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a word that comes to\Nmind, and that word is failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to keep my promise to Iso.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to save Keen and Kiku,\Nand myself, of course, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what of me? Surely I'm worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,saving too this fire is crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It needs to chill. Where are\Nwe supposed to go? Sora's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:09:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna make it at this rate I\Ngotta get him to chop her before
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,he kicks the bucket If we don't\Ndo something about the fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll all be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done for! I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Will somebody save me? Help us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your traps!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Complainin' ain't gonna do deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me leave you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We promise we'll behave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.44,0:09:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We hit another dead end! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not the fire,\Nthen it's the debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Did somebody do this on\Npurpose to lock us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die in battle, I can accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure as hell\Nnot gonna burn to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of fight is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This damn fire won't get\Nthe best of me! Or me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll pull through!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us proceed with the plans, Sir Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,With haste, if you don't mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for placing your faith in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not fail! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy formed an alliance\Nwith you, samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never doubt your worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! I am ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, my trusted new ally!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us see this through!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been prepared for\Nthis since that accursed day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.84,0:10:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Diori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.20,0:10:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This way! And make taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.16,0:10:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To my shame, I couldn't\Nsave Lord Odin that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I allowed Lord Momonosuke and the\Nothers to suffer in those flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the power of my\Nninjutsu, I still failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no greater regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That feeling of helplessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen rain like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how Zanesha takes a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Causing a mighty downpour\Nin the process, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My brave friends, I will not\Nlet you perish in this fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I kept you waiting so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The water that I borrowed from\NZunesha's back shall flow once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Ninpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrolling to Zul!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, the elephant's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ani-ni-ni! Restoration!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This certainly is a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Water, art, fish, and jiu-jitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ocean current Soldier throw
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your way through every hall
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The walkers of the sun shall\Ndeliver you from this hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to carry me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the least we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're banged up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.98,0:13:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere for us to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to work, Momonosuke.\NWhy Kaido is still
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,alive isn't he you need\Nto be the one holding up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the island not him so\Nstart making flame clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,support the entire\Nisland myself but that is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.98,0:13:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,simply not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's wearing down. It won't hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If we wait, all of our allies might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've nearly won this, but\Nyou still must do your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your people need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the only choice\Nwe had from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To save Wano, you must protect Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Make those flame clowns now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't lose focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to try that's\Neasier said than done
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, you must go\Nalong with Kin'emon and the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,others you must travel\N20 years into the future
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And rebuild the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too much to ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Get you and Iori, come with me at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke, your mother is suffering\Nfar more from this than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the land of samurai where you must
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,maintain honor or face\Ndeath this brave woman has
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,displayed unflinching\Nresolve a man cannot show
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.40,0:15:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,cowardice in the face\Nof that it would be an
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:16:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,unbearable shame i'm a\Nchild there's nothing i can
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,do lord odin has left us\Nso with all due respect
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you are no longer just\Nan ordinary child you are
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun and the air of\Na distinguished samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means you will be\NShogun of this country someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If the young Lord will not go,\Nthen I have one final request.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,May we go forth to fight\Nour enemies once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I stay here, I will only burn to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me die like a samurai,\Nfighting with sword in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us this mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.46,0:16:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us serve our fallen Lord,\Nas we have all vowed to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.94,0:17:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, live on, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can I show my face to mother now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not a mere child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not weak or useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.44,0:17:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the man who will become\NShogun of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save the land of\NWano and stop Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.08,0:17:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop, not go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Grabbing lightning\Nstraight from the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're clever?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what an absurd power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa-whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.44,0:19:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:19:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Has this become a game to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.00,0:20:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then play around all you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take more than a\NDevil Fruit to win this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.60,0:20:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wadju showed us the\Ntruth with his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He became king without a\NDevil Fruit power to rely on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:20:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Because in the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Harking trumps all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroyer of Death, Thunder, Bagua!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To the ones we've lost, set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let your sky boats fly Steady,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.14,0:21:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,steady Steady,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.64,0:21:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,steady, ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:22:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,go The festival's almost over It's funny\NI'd almost forgotten that I'm a slave
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I can survive another\Nyear to see this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.14,0:22:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Find my daddy up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,get your grubby hand off\Nme is this supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,be a joke you're making\Nyourself an easy target
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon twister
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.36,0:22:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,demolition breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.60,0:23:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you're still vulnerable to\Ncutting attacks in your new form.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.90,0:23:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your ass down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, the nail came free!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That last tremor has released\Nme from this hellish prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.46,0:23:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't escape, I'll at\Nleast take you down with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:24:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you watching, Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.30,0:24:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your daughter is at my mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.24,0:24:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to hell together!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.06,0:24:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things,\NOnigashima is about to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.20,0:24:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Kaido's starting\Nto lose. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.12,0:24:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we have two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.26,0:24:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.22,0:24:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.26,0:24:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat beats Kaido, the\Nisland falls down and we all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.16,0:24:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Option two, we make it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.68,0:24:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Kaido survives the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.84,0:24:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.00,0:24:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.54,0:24:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a kid back in Hakumai\Nthat I'm fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.26,0:24:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm fighting for\Nmy wife back in Ringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.66,0:24:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaido gets his ass kicked, our\Nfamilies can live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.70,0:24:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a great country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:25:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone down there will\Nhave a bright future.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.06,0:25:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you samurai out of your damn minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.88,0:25:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be allowed\Nto enjoy it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.18,0:25:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's fine by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.78,0:25:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Make Kaido pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.82,0:25:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.90,0:25:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here to win this fight! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.30,0:25:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We both back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.06,0:25:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.10,0:25:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.04,0:25:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No fire to get the best of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.40,0:25:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.86,0:25:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.14,0:25:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku! Get him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.98,0:26:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.42,0:26:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.70,0:26:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Monikashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.94,0:26:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.68,0:26:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to wrap this fight up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.24,0:26:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But you gotta move that\Nisland out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.96,0:26:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,His fist is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.16,0:26:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He could punch a hole straight\Nthrough Onigashima with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.48,0:26:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.39,0:26:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.34,0:26:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready yet! Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.44,0:26:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.82,0:26:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
